u or [for its] transfer [to someone else].\"","j":15,"h":29,"s":17,"a":56,"sd":null},{"k":"17:57","t":"Those whom they invoke seek means of access to their Lord, [striving as to] which of them would be nearest, and they hope for His mercy and fear His punishment. Indeed, the punishment of your Lord is ever feared.","j":15,"h":29,"s":17,"a":57,"sd":null},{"k":"17:58","t":"And there is no city but that We will destroy it before the Day of Resurrection or punish it with a severe punishment. That has ever been in the Register inscribed.","j":15,"h":29,"s":17,"a":58,"sd":null}],"juz":15,"hizb":29,"surahs":[17],"sajdah":false}